  'who are credential evaluation professionals?' => '谁是认证评估专家？',
  'definition of a credential evaluation professional' => '认证评估专业人员的定义',
  'a credential evaluation professional is an individual who is involved with the assessment and/or recognition of international educational credentials. the evaluations provided by credential evaluation professionals assist educational institutions, regulatory bodies, assessment agencies, employers, government authorities and others to appropriately recognize international education.' => '证书评估专业人士是指参与国际教育证书评估和/或认可的个人。证书评估专业人员提供的评估有助于教育机构、监管机构、评估机构、雇主、政府当局和其他方面适当地承认国际教育。',
  'responsibilities of a credential evaluation professional:' => '认证评估专业人员的职责：',
  'promote fair, credible, standardized methods for evaluation' => '推广公正、可信、规范的评估方法',
  'collaborate to encourage consistency and to facilitate the portability of evaluations at the regional, national and global levels' => '合作鼓励区域、国家和全球各级的一致性并促进评价的可移植性',
  'ascribe to the statement of ethics' => '归因于道德声明',
  'encourage equitable access to services and transparency of the process' => '鼓励公平获得服务和过程的透明度',
  'statement of ethics for a credential evaluation professional:' => '认证评估专业人士的道德声明：',
  'academic documents may confer on the holder certain rights, or confirm the acquisition of skills and knowledge. the documents can afford benefits of both a status and monetary nature. for that reason, the professionals in the field of credential evaluation must adhere to a strict code of ethics.' => '学术文件可以授予持有者某些权利，或确认其获得的技能和知识。这些文件既能带来地位上的好处，也能带来金钱上的好处。因此，在证书评估领域的专业人员必须遵守严格的道德规范。',
  'a credential evaluation professional will:' => '认证评估专业人员将：',
  'provide the highest level of service and not discriminate on any grounds such as the applicant’s gender, race, color, disability, language, religion, sexual orientation, political or other opinion; national, ethnic or social origin; association with a national minority, property, birth or other status; or on the grounds of any other circumstance not related to the merits of the qualification for which recognition is sought.' => '提供最高水平的服务，不得以申请人的性别、种族、肤色、残疾、语言、宗教、性取向、政治或其他见解；民族、族裔或社会出身；与少数民族的联系、财产、出生或其他身份；或任何其他情况下的歧视与申请承认的资格的优点无关。',
  'distinguish between personal convictions and professional duties, and not allow personal beliefs to interfere with the fair and accurate evaluation of credentials.' => '区分个人信念和职业责任，不允许个人信仰干扰公正、准确的资格评审。',
  'ensure fairness and transparency in all aspects of the assessment process.' => '确保评估过程所有方面的公平和透明。',
  'ensure that evaluation decisions are consistent and are based on appropriate information (taking into consideration institution, organizational or governmental regulations and/or policies, as applicable).' => '确保评估决定是一致的，并基于适当的信息（考虑到机构、组织或政府的法规和/或政策，如适用）。',
  'strive for excellence in the profession by maintaining and enhancing knowledge and skills, by encouraging the professional development of colleagues, and by fostering the aspirations of potential members of the profession.' => '通过保持和提高知识和技能，通过鼓励同事的专业发展，以及通过培养该行业潜在成员的抱负，努力在专业领域取得卓越成就。',
  'degree assessed-for immigration' => '移民评估学位',
  'evaluation of academic qualifications for immigration' => '移民学历评估',
  'apply' => '应用',
  'for technical or economic immigrants to canada, the canadian immigration, refugee and citizenship commission (ircc) formally requires candidates to submit their canadian academic equivalence or educational credit assessment (eca) in their immigration application. under the new immigration policy, fast entry and educational attainments have a higher value. main applicants, including their spouses, can receive their total comprehensive ranking system (csr) score. for u.s. h-1b visas, u.s. citizenship and immigration services requires a bachelor\'s degree or higher degree or its equivalent evaluation report.' => '对于到加拿大的技术或经济移民，加拿大移民、难民和公民身份委员会（IRCC）正式要求候选人在其移民申请中提交其加拿大学业同等或教育信用评估（ECA）。在新的移民政策下，快速入境和教育成就具有更高的价值。主要申请人，包括他们的配偶，可以得到他们的综合排名系统（CSR）总分。对于美国H-1B签证，美国公民和移民服务局需要学士学位或更高学位或同等评估报告。',
  'service description:' => '服务说明：',
  'when you apply for the dae-special report, you do not need to provide us with the corresponding documents. you can download the relevant certification materials and send them to us through the service agency of the ministry of education in the country where your education is located. the certification materials are different, so wse does not make special requirements for such students, but you must ensure that the materials you submit can prove your academic and academic information' => '当您申请DAE特别报告时，您不需要向我们提供相应的文件。您可以下载相关证明材料，并通过您所在国教育部服务机构发送给我们。认证材料不同，因此WSE对此类学生不作特殊要求，但您必须确保您提交的材料能够证明您的学术和学术信息',
  'analysis items include' => '分析项目包括',
  'credit and grade equivalent of university courses' => '大学课程学分与学分等值',
  'the average score of each education certificate' => '各学历证书平均分',
  'identify advanced courses for undergraduate or professional study' => '确定本科或专业学习的高级课程',
  'undergraduate or professional learning and practice ability matching' => '本科或专业学习实践能力匹配',
  'referral agencies or licensing committees request specific information about course content' => '推荐机构或授权委员会要求提供有关课程内容的具体信息',
  'sample evaluation book' => '评估书样本',
  'wse assessment report card' => 'WSE评估报告卡',
  'evaluation fee: since the wse appraisal personnel need to carry out multi-party verification on the information you submitted, more fees will be incurred. for details, please go to <a href=\'\'>the service and fees</a> for related fee information' => '评估费：由于WSE评估人员需要对您提交的信息进行多方核实，因此会产生更多的费用。有关详细信息，请访问<a href=\'\'>服务和费用</a>获取相关费用信息',
  'degree assessment' => '学位评定',
  'easy to apply' => '易于使用',
  'We abandon the traditional way of mailing documents for information exchange. You can directly apply and submit information on our website without sending any certification materials to us. At the same time, we will simplify the assessment data submission process and data submission content as much as possible. Although we have simplified the application process, we use blockchain distributed storage technology to help us store information. This storage is open and transparent and will not be modified, so please ensure that the information is true when you provide us with information. The presence of false information will be lifelong for you.' => '我们放弃了传统的邮寄文件进行信息交换的方式。您可以直接在我们的网站上申请和提交信息，而无需向我们发送任何证明材料。同时，尽可能简化评估数据报送流程和数据报送内容。虽然我们简化了应用程序，但我们使用区块链分布式存储技术来帮助我们存储信息。此存储是开放和透明的，不会被修改，因此请确保您在向我们提供信息时所提供的信息是真实的。虚假信息的存在对你来说将是终生的。',
  'Fast service' => '快速服务',
  'When you conduct an assessment, we cannot determine whether your needs for the assessment are urgent, so we always take the urgent needs of customers as our working purpose, quickly serve customer service as the service goal, and always serve as the center of customer service.' => '在您进行评估时，我们无法确定您对评估的需求是否迫切，因此我们始终以客户的迫切需求为工作宗旨，以快速服务客户为服务目标，始终以客户服务为中心。',
  'We have a review team composed of hundreds of people to process the data submitted every day, we will respond to you quickly after you submit the information, no matter which country you are in the world, you can usually receive the assessment within five working days As a result, we are constantly improving for shorter service times.' => '我们有一个由数百人组成的审核小组，每天对提交的数据进行处理，我们会在您提交信息后迅速回复您，无论您在世界上哪个国家，您通常可以在五个工作日内收到评估结果，因此我们不断改进以缩短服务时间。',
  'Evaluation authority' => '评估机构',
  'Our evaluation team is from more than 30 countries around the world, providing professional knowledge from different countries for your evaluation. Now our evaluation team has helped millions of students to evaluate and help them solve transnational learning, work, immigration Waiting for the proof of academic qualifications' => '我们的评估团队来自世界30多个国家，为您的评估提供来自不同国家的专业知识。现在我们的评估团队已经帮助数百万学生进行评估，帮助他们解决跨国学习、工作、移民等学历证明问题',
  'The WSE customized database currently contains tens of thousands of learning institutions and nearly one hundred thousand academic information, these resources can ensure that your assessment is not only accurate and fair, but also based on the latest information available and rigorously researched information' => 'WSE定制数据库目前包含上万个学习机构和近十万个学术信息，这些资源可以确保您的评估不仅是准确和公正的，而且是基于现有的最新信息和经过严格研究的信息',
  'Safe and reliable data storage' => '安全可靠的数据存储',
  'WSE has exclusively created a service for permanent storage of academic information. Based on the technical characteristics of blockchain distributed storage, we permanently store the academic information of students. You can query your academic information at any time with the Internet' => 'WSE专门创建了一个永久存储学术信息的服务。基于区块链分布式存储的技术特点，我们永久存储学生的学术信息。你可以随时上网查询你的学术信息',
  'Because of the blockchain distributed storage technology used for storage, your information storage does not depend on WSE and any one institution. You can perform blockchain trusted certificate inquiry and verification through the network. So you don\'t have to worry about your information being stored in WSE and relying too much on WSE.' => '由于用于存储的区块链分布式存储技术，您的信息存储不依赖于WSE和任何一个机构。您可以通过网络进行区块链可信证书查询和验证。因此，您不必担心信息存储在WSE中，也不必过于依赖WSE。',
  'Degree Assessment Application Process' => '学位评定申请流程',
  'If you are ready to apply for the evaluation storage service, you can follow the steps below to apply' => '如果您准备好申请评估存储服务，可以按照以下步骤进行申请',
  'Register a WSE account' => '注册WSE帐户',
  'If you don\'t have a WSE account yet, you need to go to the registration page to apply for an <b>account</b>.' => '如果您还没有WSE帐户，则需要转到注册页来申请<b>帐户</b>。',
  'If you already have a WSE account, you can ignore this step' => '如果您已经有WSE帐户，则可以忽略此步骤',
  'step' => '步骤2',
  'Find the service application page to submit information' => '查找服务应用程序页面以提交信息',
  'If you have already <b>registered a WSE account</b> and successfully logged in, you can go to the application page to fill in the information and submit information according to the prompts' => '如果您已经<b>注册了WSE帐户</b>并成功登录，则可以转到应用程序页面填写信息并根据提示提交信息',
  'LOGIN' => '登录',
  'We accept your information for evaluation' => '我们接受您的信息以供评估',
  'After you fill in all the information and submit all the information, we will evaluate your information in about 5 working days. Of course, if the information you submitted is not true, we will not evaluate your information' => '在您填写所有信息并提交所有信息后，我们将在大约5个工作日内评估您的信息。当然，如果您提交的信息不真实，我们不会评估您的信息',
  'We will send you the evaluation result file' => '我们会把评估结果文件寄给你',
  'After we verify that your information has no problems and make a successful evaluation, we will notify you by email and mail the documents to your home' => '在我们确认您的信息没有问题并且评估成功后，我们将通过电子邮件通知您，并将文档邮寄到您的家中',
  'Store your information file' => '存储您的信息文件',
  'After you have successfully received the assessment document and confirmed that it is correct, we will store your information and information in the blockchain, this process will take a while' => '在您成功收到评估文件并确认其正确无误后，我们会将您的信息和信息存储在区块链中，此过程需要一段时间',
  'About Degree Assessed-General Application' => '关于学位评定的一般应用',
  'Help you quickly assess your academic qualifications' => '帮助你快速评估你的学历',
  'Degree Assessed-General Application' => '学位评定通用',
  'If you are seeking employment, professional licensing or further study in Canada, let WSE help you achieve your goals. WSE evaluates formal for-credit educational programs of study for people who have studied in other countries and then determines comparable levels in British Columbian and Canadian terms. The results of an WSE assessment are provided in evaluation reports that are objective, consistent, and reliable.' => '如果您正在加拿大寻求就业、职业执照或进修，请让WSE帮助您实现您的目标。WSE评估在其他国家学习过的人的正式学分教育课程，然后用不列颠哥伦比亚和加拿大的术语确定可比水平。WSE评估的结果以客观、一致和可靠的评估报告提供。',
  'Analysis items include:' => '分析项目包括：',
  'Sample evaluation' => '样品评价',
  'Sample results' => '样本结果',
  'Evaluation Fees: Please go to <a href=\'\'> Services and Fees</a>for related fee information' => '评估费：请访问<a href=\'\'>服务和费用</a>了解相关费用信息',
  'Features of Degree Assessment ' => '评价特征度',
  'We abandon the traditional way of mailing documents for information exchange. You can directly apply and submit information on our website without sending any certification materials to us. At the same time, we will simplify the assessment data submission process and data submission content as much as possible.' => '我们放弃了传统的邮寄文件进行信息交换的方式。您可以直接在我们的网站上申请和提交信息，而无需向我们发送任何证明材料。同时，尽可能简化评估数据报送流程和数据报送内容。',
  'Although we have simplified the application process, we use blockchain distributed storage technology to help us store information. This storage is open and transparent and will not be modified, so please ensure that the information is true when you provide us with information. The presence of false information will be lifelong for you.' => '虽然我们简化了应用程序，但我们使用区块链分布式存储技术来帮助我们存储信息。此存储是开放和透明的，不会被修改，因此请确保您在向我们提供信息时所提供的信息是真实的。虚假信息的存在对你来说将是终生的。',
  'DAE-Special Report Application Process' => 'DAE专项报告申请流程',
  'Who are our members?' => '谁是我们的会员？',
  'Our membership is comprised of individuals, academic institutions, independent agencies, and organizations who share a common interest in international credential evaluation, directly or indirectly' => '我们的会员包括个人、学术机构、独立机构和组织，他们直接或间接地在国际认证评估方面有共同的兴趣',
  'How does WSE support our professionals?' => 'WSE如何支持我们的专业人士？',
  'WSE offers an opportunity to take charge of your career. We provide opportunities to participate in activities that relate directly to our profession such as country-specific webinars, in-person conferences, and a forum for networking within other international credential evaluation professionals' => 'WSE提供了一个机会来管理你的事业。我们提供参与与我们专业直接相关的活动的机会，如针对国家的网络研讨会、面对面会议以及与其他国际认证评估专业人士建立联系的论坛',
  'WSE fills the gaps that currently exist among the various professional organizations by providing a one-stop-shop for resources, professional development, networking, and one-on-one access to highly specialized expertise across the profession.' => 'WSE通过提供一站式的资源、专业发展、网络和一对一访问整个行业高度专业化的专业知识，填补了目前各专业组织之间存在的空白。',
  'How does WSE support the field?' => 'WSE如何支持该领域？',
  'International credential evaluation is a small, highly specialized field that will need to grow to take care of the influx of international students and professionals who are increasingly sought after and mobile. WSE is an official organization committed to moving the field of international credential evaluation forward, through activities such as research, determining best practices, supporting professional development' => '国际文凭评估是一个小的，高度专业化的领域，需要发展，以照顾涌入的国际学生和专业人士谁是越来越受追捧和流动。WSE是一个官方组织，致力于通过研究、确定最佳实践、支持专业发展等活动推动国际认证评估领域的发展',
  'How can WSE help if you are not an international credential evaluator?' => '如果您不是国际认证评估师，WSE如何提供帮助？',
  'Many organizations and institutions outsource their international credential evaluations. One must know how to apply the information in the evaluation reports to the institution or organization. Being a WSE member gives you direct access to international credential evaluation professionals who may assist you in understanding evaluation methodologies and how your institution should handle evaluation reports received' => '许多组织和机构将其国际认证评估外包。必须知道如何将评估报告中的信息应用于机构或组织。作为WSE会员，您可以直接接触到国际认证评估专家，他们可能会帮助您理解评估方法以及您的机构应该如何处理收到的评估报告',
  'How can you become involved with WSE?' => '你如何参与到WSE中来？',
  'Become a member or sponsor of this unique professional organization' => '成为这个独特的专业组织的成员或赞助人',
  'Attend a conference' => '参加会议',
  'Participate in committees, task forces, or on boards' => '参加委员会、工作组或董事会',
  'Do research and offer conference sessions' => '做研究并提供会议会议',
  'Where can I find information on professional development activities offered by WSE?' => '我在哪里可以找到有关WSE提供的专业发展活动的信息？',
  'Do I have to be a member of WSE to participate in these activities?' => '我必须是WSE的成员才能参加这些活动吗？',
  'Information on professional development is available to WSE’s website for members and non-members alike. However, membership grants access to exclusive opportunities as well as discounted registration to the general meeting and other events' => '关于专业发展的信息可以在WSE的网站上找到，供会员和非会员使用。但是，会员资格授予会员大会和其他活动的独家机会以及折扣注册',
  'Can I volunteer as trainer for professional development activities such as webinars?' => '我是否可以自愿作为培训师参加网络研讨会等专业发展活动？',
  'Yes! WSE thrives due to volunteer efforts of the credential evaluation community. Please contact WSE’s Executive Director, Robert Prather at' => '对！WSE的繁荣得益于证书评估社区的志愿者努力。请联系WSE的执行董事，Robert Prather',
