  'Sandy Gault, University of Missouri-Kansas City' => '桑迪·高尔特，密苏里大学堪萨斯城分校',
  'Kitty Villa, Retired, University of Texas at Austin' => '凯蒂·维拉，退休，德克萨斯大学奥斯汀分校',
  'Institutions listed for identification purposes only' => '仅用于识别目的的机构',
  '<a>Strategic Plan and Committee Action Plans' => '<a>战略计划和委员会行动计划',
  'WSE 2018-2019 STRATEGIC PLAN' => 'WSE 2018-2019战略计划',
  'INTRODUCTION' => '简介',
  'Word Service Education (WSE) was incorporated in 2013. In the relatively short span of time from incorporation until now, our association has grown and contributed to our field at an impressive pace. Official membership has topped 200, we represent over 15 countries and have held three successful international conferences. We have provided resources and training to people who do the important work of international credential assessment' => '文字服务教育（WSE）于2013年成立。从公司成立到现在，在相对较短的时间内，我们的协会以令人印象深刻的速度成长并为我们的领域做出了贡献。正式会员超过200人，代表15多个国家，成功举办了三届国际会议。我们为从事国际认证评估重要工作的人员提供了资源和培训',
  'In order to meet the needs of our membership and continue to contribute to the world community by doing work that supports the movement of people across borders for educational, commercial and personal reasons, we need to plan. In September 2017 we completed a comprehensive process that resulted in this plan that will set the strategic direction of the organization in the years ahead' => '为了满足会员国的需要，继续为国际社会作出贡献，我们需要制定计划，支持因教育、商业和个人原因而跨越国界的人员流动。2017年9月，我们完成了一个全面的过程，该计划将为本组织今后几年的战略方向确定方向',
  'PROCESS' => '过程',
  'The strategic planning process included the following' => '战略规划过程包括以下内容',
  'Stakeholder input and information gathering' => '利益相关者输入和信息收集',
  'In order to understand the needs and goals of the association members and to review the association’s position in the international education environment, we collected data. We surveyed the WSE membership, all current WSE leaders, and all candidates for elected WSE positions. We gathered data on the current state of our association, on our external environment, and the international education community in which our members do their work' => '为了了解协会成员的需求和目标，以及评估协会在国际教育环境中的地位，我们收集了数据。我们调查了WSE成员、所有现任WSE领导人以及所有当选WSE职位的候选人。我们收集了我们协会的现状、外部环境以及会员工作所在的国际教育界的数据',
  'Analysis of issues and trends by association leaders' => '协会领导人对问题和趋势的分析',
  'WSE leaders and leader candidates met for an all-day retreat as part of the third annual meeting in Rome. At the meeting we reviewed our mission and operational principles, financial condition and accomplishments. Leaders reviewed member survey results, committee priorities and issues facing the association. An environmental scan and SWOT (strengths, weaknesses, opportunities and threats) analysis provided a context for our future direction' => '作为在罗马举行的第三届年会的一部分，WSE领导人和领导人候选人举行了为期一天的静修活动。会上，我们回顾了我们的使命和业务原则、财务状况和成绩。领导们回顾了会员调查结果、委员会的优先事项和协会面临的问题。环境扫描和SWOT（优势、劣势、机遇和威胁）分析为我们未来的发展方向提供了背景',
  'AREAS OF FOCUS' => '重点领域',
  'After sifting through all the data, discussion and analysis, the group identified three major areas of focus. These, along with overarching goals, are' => '经过对所有数据的筛选、讨论和分析，小组确定了三个主要的重点领域。这些以及总体目标是',
  'By the end of 2019, have in place the Foundation Certificate and at least three subject-specific certificates to meet the needs of WSE members at all levels' => '到2019年底，建立基金会证书和至少三个学科证书，以满足各级WSE成员的需求',
  'Professional Development' => '专业发展',
  'By the end of 2019, offer a comprehensive package of professional development programs that supports WSE members at all levels' => '到2019年底，提供一套全面的专业发展计划，支持所有级别的WSE成员',
  'Finances' => '资助',
  'By the end of 2019, support the continued development of the Certificate Program, professional development and other programs, and maintain fiscal responsibility through a variety of revenue streams such as the annual conference, sponsorship, and program fees' => '到2019年底，支持证书项目、专业发展和其他项目的持续发展，通过年会、赞助和项目费用等多种收入来源维持财政责任',
  'COMMITTEE ACTION PLANS' => '委员会行动计划',
  'WSE standing and ad-hoc committees developed their annual action plans for 2018' => 'WSE常设委员会和特设委员会制定了2018年年度行动计划',
  'Committee for Standards (CFS) – Chair, Rolf Lofstad' => '标准委员会（CFS）-主席，Rolf Lofstad',
