  'Collaborate with Marketing and Communications to draft strategic messaging for past and potential donors with the objective of securing sustainable streams of donor revenue.' => '与营销和传播部门合作，为过去和潜在的捐助者起草战略信息，以确保捐助者收入的可持续来源。',
  'NEXT STEPS' => '下一步行动',
  'Managing performance:</b> Association leaders will set up systems of accountability and communication to ensure that goals are met and results are communicated to WSE members' => '管理绩效：</b>协会领导将建立责任制和沟通体系，以确保实现目标并将结果传达给WSE成员',
  'SUMMARY' => '摘要',
  'The strategic planning process was successful due to the active participation of WSE members and leaders. A great deal of thoughtful detail and input by members not included in this report, but nonetheless recorded and noted, will help to guide leaders in their work. Continued input and volunteer contributions by many members have and will continue to make WSE a successful association. The strategic plan will help us remain focused on the needs and wishes of membership.' => '由于WSE成员和领导人的积极参与，战略规划过程取得了成功。本报告中没有包括但有记录和记录的成员提出的大量深思熟虑的细节和投入，将有助于指导领导人的工作。许多会员的持续投入和志愿者贡献已经并将继续使WSE成为一个成功的协会。战略计划将帮助我们继续关注会员国的需要和愿望。',
  'WSE will continue to serve its members as they contribute to the world community by doing work that supports the movement of people across borders for educational, commercial and personal reasons, building a stronger and better world' => 'WSE将继续为其成员国服务，帮助他们为国际社会作出贡献，支持人们因教育、商业和个人原因而跨境流动，建设一个更强大、更美好的世界',
  'Notes:' => '笔记：',
  'Those attending the strategic planning retreat included current leaders and 2018 leader candidates (Board and Committee Chairs): Christopher Adams, Cloud Bai-Yun, Jeanie Bell, Denise Benz, LesLee Clauson Eicher, Kate Freeman, Diana Hense, Rolf Lofstad, Shereen Mir-Jabbar, Lou Nunes, Margit Schatzman, and Jessica Stannard' => '参加战略规划务虚会的包括现任领导人和2018年领导人候选人（董事会和委员会主席）：克里斯托弗·亚当斯、云朵白云、珍妮·贝尔、丹尼斯·本茨、莱斯利·克劳森·艾切尔、凯特·弗里曼、戴安娜·亨斯、罗尔夫·洛夫斯塔德、谢琳·米尔·贾巴尔、卢·努内斯、玛吉特·沙茨曼和杰西卡·斯坦纳德',
  'Leaders unable to attend, but who contributed to the preparation and success of the strategic planning process include David Haynes, Marshall Houserman, George Kacenga, Ken Warren, and Robert Prather (Executive Director).' => '未能出席，但为战略规划过程的准备和成功作出贡献的领导人包括大卫·海恩斯、马歇尔·豪斯曼、乔治·卡森加、肯·沃伦和罗伯特·普拉瑟（执行董事）。',
