  'Copy of application' => '申请书副本',
  'The certificate is missing or not enough, apply for more copies for use' => '证书丢失或不足，请申请更多副本以供使用',
  'In many cases, some employers or institutions need to keep your evaluation report, which will cause you to have no evaluation report available in the future, so WSE has opened a copy application service' => '在很多情况下，一些雇主或机构需要保留你的评估报告，这会导致你将来没有评估报告，所以WSE已经开通了一个副本申请服务',
  'To apply for a copy, you need to initiate an application with us and pay the corresponding cost, and we will send you a copy in a short time' => '要申请复印件，您需要向我们提出申请并支付相应的费用，我们会在短时间内给您发送一份副本',
  'WSE refuses to make a copy for you under the following circumstances' => '在下列情况下，WSE拒绝为您制作副本',
  'Users with false information submitted and blacklisted by WSE' => '提交虚假信息并被WSE列入黑名单的用户',
  'Your evaluation report has expired, please go to the help center to check the validity period of the WSE evaluation certificate' => '您的评估报告已过期，请前往帮助中心查看WSE评估证书的有效期',
  'When someone reports to the WSE that you use the assessment for illegal purposes' => '当有人向WSE报告您将评估用于非法目的时',
