  'Restrictions on copy application' => '复印申请限制',
  'In order to avoid the situation of illegal transaction evaluation, WSE has restricted the application of copies. If you really need a large number of evaluations due to special circumstances, please contact WSE customer service to apply' => '为了避免非法交易评估的情况，WSE限制了副本的应用。如因特殊情况确需大量评估，请联系WSE客服申请',
