  'total amount' => '总金额',
  'Note' => '注意',
  'The above fee does not include the money we send you for text express delivery. Please check the "<a href="">extra fee</a> " section for the detailed express delivery fee' => '以上费用不包括我们寄给您的短信快递费。请查看“<a href=”“>额外费用</a>”部分了解详细的快递费',
  'If you have successfully applied for the WSE degree evaluation education service, you can apply for this project. This project is mainly used to replace the use of data. If you find that the information you submitted is wrong, please apply for this project to make changes' => '如果您已成功申请WSE学位评估教育服务，您可以申请此项目。本项目主要用于替代数据的使用。如果您发现您提交的信息有误，请申请此项目进行更改',
  'If you have not applied for WSE degree assessment education services, please go to <a href="">apply</a>' => '如果您尚未申请WSE学位评估教育服务，请前往<a href=“”>申请</a>',
  'We will re-evaluate your submitted data after updating the data, reprint the evaluation copy and re-chain, we will charge you a certain fee, the specific fee is shown in the table below.' => '我们会在更新数据后重新评估您提交的数据，重新打印评估副本并重新链接，我们会向您收取一定的费用，具体费用如下表所示。',
  'If you have successfully applied for the WSE degree evaluation education service, you can apply for this project. This project is mainly used to store your academic qualifications lower than your current academic qualifications. If you want to store the current academic qualifications to replace the stored low academic qualifications, please apply This item updates stored data' => '如果您已成功申请WSE学位评估教育服务，您可以申请此项目。此项目主要用于存储低于当前学历的学历。如果您想存储当前学历以替换存储的低学历，请应用此项更新存储的数据',
  'If you have not applied for WSE degree assessment education services, please go directly to' => '如果您尚未申请WSE学位评估教育服务，请直接前往',
  'We will re-evaluate your submitted data after updating the data, reprint the evaluation copy and re-chain, we will charge you a certain fee, the specific fee is shown in the table below' => '我们会在更新数据后重新评估您提交的数据，重新打印评估副本并重新链接，我们会向您收取一定的费用，具体费用如下表所示',
  'The above fee does not include the money we send you for text express delivery. Please check the' => '以上费用不包括我们寄给您的短信快递费。请检查',
  'section for the detailed express delivery fee' => '详细的快递费部分',
  'Although WSE has helped many students to conduct assessments, WSE is only an institution for assessment education in the world. In some countries or specific scenarios, it only accepts assessments from national education institutions. In order to prevent you from repeatedly submitting information and lowering For efficiency evaluation, WSE can transfer your data to the authoritative evaluation agencies of other countries in the world. Of course, the premise of the transmission is that you have applied for the WSE degree evaluation education service' => '虽然WSE帮助了许多学生进行评估，但WSE只是世界上一个评估教育机构。在某些国家或特定情况下，它只接受国家教育机构的评估。为了防止您重复提交信息和降低效率评估，WSE可以将您的数据传输给世界其他国家的权威评估机构。当然，传递的前提是你已经申请了WSE学位评估教育服务',
  'If you have not applied for WSE degree assessment education services, please go to' => '如果您尚未申请WSE学位评估教育服务，请访问',
  'Data transmission because different countries and transmission target institutions have different reception standards for transmission data, so there is no fixed charging standard for transmission, subject to the determination of the charging page after the application is approved for transmission' => '数据传输由于不同国家和传输目标机构对传输数据有不同的接收标准，因此传输没有固定的收费标准，以申请批准传输后收费页面的确定为准',
  'In addition to providing services to individuals, we also cooperate with many university institutions to help them store students academic information, which to a large extent helps them solve the problem of student information loss' => '除了为个人提供服务外，我们还与许多大学机构合作，帮助他们存储学生的学术信息，这在很大程度上帮助他们解决了学生信息丢失的问题',
  'Because different schools have different storage requirements, we can\'t make a very clear pricing for this service. This requires you to provide us with detailed storage requirements. We will customize detailed storage solutions and interface docking according to your storage needs After the plan can be determined, if you are interested in this service or want to know the details, please send us an email message, we will reply to your email in 24 hours' => '因为不同的学校有不同的存储要求，我们无法对这项服务作出非常明确的定价。这需要您向我们提供详细的存储要求。计划确定后，我们将根据您的存储需求定制详细的存储解决方案和接口对接，如果您对此服务感兴趣或想了解详情，请给我们发邮件，我们会在24小时内回复您的邮件',
  'WSE contact email' => 'WSE联系人电子邮件',
  'Extra cost' => '额外费用',
  'If you have successfully passed our evaluation application, we will mail your evaluation report and related evaluation materials to you. Mailing will incur costs. The specific costs are described in the table below' => '如果您成功通过我们的评估申请，我们会将您的评估报告和相关评估材料邮寄给您。邮寄会产生费用。具体费用见下表',
  'Delivery service' => '送货服务',
  'US Priority Mail Delivery' => '美国优先邮件递送',
  'Delivery only anywhere in the United States, within 2 to 3 days' => '只在美国的任何地方交货，2到3天',
  'Contains trace messages' => '包含跟踪消息',
  'No signature required' => '无需签名',
  'payment method' => '付款方式',
  'We will accept PayPal payments via PayPal or online payments by credit/debit card (Visa or MasterCard)' => '我们将接受PayPal支付或通过信用卡/借记卡（Visa或MasterCard）在线支付',
  'Who are Credential Evaluation Professionals' => '谁是认证评估专家',
  'One of WSE’s goals is to “Develop and Promote Common Standards.” The Professional Competency Profile for Credential Evaluators (PCP) and the Guide to Credential Evaluation (‘Guide’) represent important statements regarding our profession and are the result of two years of dedicated work by the WSE Committee for Standards. The Board would like to thank Sarah Ledwidge, Emily Tse, Margaret Wenger, and Rolf Lofstad (Chair) for their hard work in helping WSE to accomplish this important organizational goal' => 'WSE的目标之一是“开发和推广通用标准”。证书评估师的职业能力简介（PCP）和证书评估指南（“指南”）代表了有关我们专业的重要声明，是WSE标准委员会两年专注工作的结果。董事会要感谢Sarah Ledwidge、Emily Tse、Margaret Wenger和Rolf Lofstad（主席）为帮助WSE实现这一重要的组织目标所做的辛勤工作',
  'The PCP is intended to be a defining document for our profession – it outlines what we believe to be the key characteristics, qualifications, and role of Evaluators and Senior Evaluators. The ‘Guide’ represents a common framework for evaluating credentials that should be a standard for evaluators whether they work in an agency or institutional setting. Both the PCP and Guide are ‘living’ documents’ that will be refined and updated over time as the nature of our work as international credential evaluators evolves' => 'PCP旨在成为我们专业的定义性文件——它概述了我们认为评估师和高级评估师的关键特征、资格和作用。“指南”代表了一个评估证书的通用框架，该框架应成为评估人员的标准，无论他们是在机构还是机构环境中工作。PCP和指南都是“活的”文件，随着我们工作性质的发展，随着国际认证评估人员的发展，这些文件将随着时间的推移进行改进和更新',
  'WSE is, and will continue to be, focused on the development of professional standards in international credential evaluation and the professional development of those who do this important work' => 'WSE现在，并将继续专注于国际认证评估的专业标准的制定以及从事这项重要工作的人员的专业发展',
  'Educational Evaluation And Permanent Storage Solutions' => '教育评估和永久存储解决方案',
  'What is evaluation storage?' => '什么是评估存储？',
  'The assessment storage includes two services: Assessment and Blockchain Storage.' => '评估存储包括两个服务：评估和区块链存储。',
  'Assessment: You can choose a general assessment or immigration assessment according to your actual needs. The assessment is an assessment of your academic information through WSE, and an assessment report and WSE assessment report will be formed for your different needs.' => '评估：您可以根据您的实际需要选择一般评估或移民评估。你的评估和评估报告将通过你的评估报告形成。',
  'Blockchain Storage: To ensure data security, WSE uses blockchain storage technology for data storage and permanently stores your information. Stored on the blockchain. After WSE warehousing service, you will receive a series of assessment materials, such as WSE assessment report and WSE assessment transcript, which will have a very important impact on your future overseas or employment in Canada.' => '区块链存储：为确保数据安全，WSE使用区块链存储技术进行数据存储，并永久存储您的信息。存储在区块链上。WSE仓储服务结束后，您将收到一系列评估材料，如WSE评估报告和WSE评估成绩单，这些材料将对您未来的海外或加拿大就业产生非常重要的影响。',
  'What is the use of evaluation storage?' => '评估存储的用途是什么？',
  'The evaluation storage application will evaluate your data. The evaluation report and WSE evaluation report you receive will play an important role in many scenarios such as your study, work, life, etc.' => '评估存储应用程序将评估您的数据。您收到的评估报告和WSE评估报告将在您的学习、工作、生活等许多场景中发挥重要作用。',
  'If you want to study abroad (whether you are studying abroad from Canada or studying abroad in Canada), your academic qualifications in your home country will cause you a lot of obstacles when you study abroad because of country differences. WSE degree evaluation can be very Good help you solve this problem' => '如果你想出国留学（无论你是在加拿大留学还是在加拿大留学），你在本国的学历会因为国家差异而给你造成很多障碍。对你的学位评估能很好的帮助你解决这个问题',
  'For Employment' => '为了就业',
  'If you are going to work abroad, employers may have difficulty understanding the academic credentials you provide. WSE degree evaluation can help employers better understand your educational background' => '如果你要出国工作，雇主可能很难理解你提供的学历证书。WSE学位评估可以帮助雇主更好地了解你的教育背景',
  'For Immigration' => '为了移民',
  'In some countries, such as the United States, the US Citizenship and Immigration Services (USCIS) recommends that applicants have a US bachelor\'s degree or higher equivalent to almost all visa certificate evaluation reports. If you want to apply for an H-1B or green card, you need a certificate evaluation report to meet these requirements.' => '在一些国家，如美国，美国公民和移民服务局（USCIS）建议申请人拥有美国学士学位或更高学位，几乎相当于所有签证证书评估报告。如果你想申请H-1B或绿卡，你需要一份证书评估报告来满足这些要求。',
  'Work Permits' => '工作许可证',
  'If you\'ve ever applied for a job, you know how important your educational experience and credentials are. If you\'re applying to a job in the U.S. and earned your educational credentials in another country, it can be difficult for employers to understand your qualifications.' => '如果你曾经申请过一份工作，你就知道你的教育经历和资历有多重要。如果你在美国申请另一份工作的学历证书很难理解。',
  'H-1B Visas' => 'H-1B签证',
  'For the U.S. H-1B Visa require a bachelor’s degree or higher degree or its equivalent evaluation report.' => '对于美国H-1B签证，要求获得学士学位或更高学位或同等学历的评估报告。',
  'In short, the degree assessment will have a very important impact on your life' => '简言之，学位评估将对你的生活产生非常重要的影响',
  'Evaluation storage In addition to "degree evaluation", WSE uses blockchain storage technology to store your data on the blockchain, so that your data will have the following benefits:' => '评估存储除了“学位评估”之外，WSE使用区块链存储技术将您的数据存储在区块链上，这样您的数据将具有以下好处：',
