  '<strong>Special Notice Concerning COVID-19 :</strong> We are open for business. The majority of our staff continues to work from home while a small, dedicated team ensures that physical documents are handled securely. Now Now you can apply for our service at WSE...' => '<strong>关于COVID-19的特别通知：</strong>我们已开始营业。我们的大多数员工继续在家工作，而一个小型的、专门的团队确保物理文档得到安全处理。现在你可以申请我们的服务了。。。',
  'Welcome To' => '欢迎来到',
  'WSE is the world\'s leading \'Degree Assessed\' and \'Blockchain Storage\' institution. We are committed to helping people around the world solve education evaluation and data storage problems.' => 'WSE是全球领先的“学位评估”和“区块链存储”机构。我们致力于帮助世界各地的人们解决教育评估和数据存储问题。',
