  'Information on the Chain' => '链上的信息',
  'The storage feature of blockchain storage is distributed storage, which refers to a unique type of system architecture. The system architecture has a set of computer nodes that communicate and coordinate work through the network to complete common tasks.' => '区块链存储的存储特点是分布式存储，它指的是一种独特的系统架构类型。系统架构有一组计算机节点，它们通过网络通信和协调工作，以完成共同的任务。',
