  'Permanently control and own your academic assessments and academic records, and store them securely on the blockchain.' => '永久控制和拥有你的学术评估和学术记录，并安全地存储在区块链上。',
  'You can get your evaluation certificate and other proofs anytime, anywhere. In addition, you can log in to WSE to "My Storage" to view and print your stored information, or share your information with otherss.' => '你可以随时随地得到你的评估证书和其他证明。此外，您可以登录到WSE的“我的存储”以查看和打印您存储的信息，或者与其他人共享您的信息。',
  'My Storage' => '我的储藏室',
  'Scenes to be Used' => '要使用的场景',
  'High-Confidence Learning Record Preservation' => '高自信学习记录保存',
  'Really save personal learning records such as CBT(Computer Based Test) and online learning, so that personal learning records are true and credible.' => '真正保存个人学习记录，如CBT（Computer Based Test）和在线学习，使个人学习记录真实可信。',
  'Save High-Confidence Data' => '保存高置信度数据',
  'Prevent the Falsification of Learning Records' => '防止伪造学习记录',
  'Share Learning Records Safely and Securely' => '安全、安全地共享学习记录',
  'Applications that restrict the scope of personal data disclosure by setting access permissions will become possible. For example, sharing of records between schools, anonymous data analysis, etc.' => '通过设置访问权限来限制个人数据泄露范围的应用程序将成为可能。例如，学校之间的记录共享，匿名数据分析等。',
  'Data Sharing Among Multiple Educational Institutions' => '多个教育机构之间的数据共享',
  'Flexible Access Control' => '灵活的访问控制',
  'Personal&nbsp; Information&nbsp; Assessment&nbsp; Storage&nbsp; Service' => '个人信息评估存储服务',
  'World Storage Education Certified Degree Data Exchange Center' => '世界存储教育认证学位数据交换中心',
  'Blockchain Storage' => '区块链存储',
  'Trusted Verification' => '可信验证',
  'You can submit your learning materials to WSE. WSE will analyze your learning materials and scientifically evaluate your materials according to the evaluation methods of WSE. Through the degree assessment, you can get the WSE degree evaluation report and WSE report card, which is of great help to your work and life in Canada' => '你可以把你的学习材料提交给WSE。WSE将分析您的学习材料，并根据WSE的评估方法对您的材料进行科学评估。通过学位评估，您可以获得WSE学位评估报告和WSE成绩单，这对您在加拿大的工作和生活有很大帮助',
  'Sample Assessment' => '样品评估',
  'Sample Transcript' => '抄本样本',
  'WSE uses data storage, point-to-point transmission, consensus mechanism, encryption algorithm and other computer technologies to store the information submitted by users, so that the data storage can be decentralized, open, autonomous, information cannot be tampered with, anonymity, etc.' => 'WSE采用数据存储、点对点传输、共识机制、加密算法等计算机技术对用户提交的信息进行存储，使数据存储具有分散性、开放性、自治性、信息不可篡改、匿名性等特点。',
  'Sample Blockchain' => '区块链示例',
  'WSE submits user information to the judicial node through the technology of blockchain storage to ensure that the information cannot be tampered to ensure the safety of the information. When there is a demand scenario for verifying the stored information, the user can conduct the information through trusted verification Check to ensure that the information is consistent with the information stored on the blockchain and has not been tampered with.' => 'WSE通过区块链存储技术向司法节点提交用户信息，保证信息不被篡改，保证信息的安全。当存在验证存储信息的需求场景时，用户可以通过可信验证检查进行信息的验证，以确保信息与存储在区块链上的信息一致，且未被篡改。',
  'WSE degree evaluation is loved and welcomed by people all over the world, but different countries have different evaluation standards. WSE cooperates with many WSE-like organizations in the world to transmit user data and try to travel to different countries for you. Provide assessment assistance for working life.' => 'WSE学位评定受到世界各国人民的喜爱和欢迎，但不同的国家有不同的评价标准。WSE与世界上许多类似WSE的组织合作，传输用户数据，并尝试为您到不同的国家旅行。为工作生活提供评估帮助。',
  'To Transfer' => '转移',
  'Institutional Storage Service' => '机构仓储服务',
  'College student data permanent storage service' => '大学生数据永久存储服务',
  'College Institutional Services Since the opening of this service, wse has attracted well-known colleges and universities from all over the world to apply to us for storing information. We combined blockchain storage technology to provide blockchain storage application channels to colleges and universities around the world Interface with data circulation, store a large amount of data information from universities around the world on the blockchain to ensure the authenticity, validity, security and openness of the data. If you are an institution or institution, you also want to be permanently safe To store data, please click Apply.' => '大学机构服务自从这项服务开通以来，吸引了世界各地的知名高校向我们申请信息存储。我们结合区块链存储技术，为全球高校提供区块链存储应用渠道，与数据流通对接，将来自世界各地高校的大量数据信息存储在区块链上，保证数据的真实性、有效性、安全性和开放性。如果您是机构或机构，您还希望永久安全地存储数据，请单击“应用”。',
