  'About Canada' => '关于加拿大',
  'Each institution in Canada sets its own admission requirements. Some are general, while others are program-specific.' => '加拿大的每一所学校都有自己的入学要求。一些是通用的，而另一些是特定于程序的。',
  'Ministries/Departments Eesponsible for Education in Canada' => '负责加拿大教育的各部',
  'Canada is a federation of 10 provinces and three territories. Under the Canadian Constitution, provincial governments have exclusive responsibility for all levels of education.' => '加拿大是一个由10个省和3个地区组成的联邦。根据加拿大宪法，省政府对各级教育负有全部责任。',
  'Postsecondary Education Systems' => '高等教育系统',
  'This report presents an overview of postsecondary education systems in Canada — their historical background, how they are structured, and how they function.' => '本报告概述了加拿大高等教育系统的历史背景、结构和功能。',
  'Canada is a top-performing country in providing quality education. In 2019, Canada welcomed over 180,000 international students1 from around the world.' => '加拿大是提供优质教育的最佳国家。2019年，加拿大迎来了来自世界各地的18万多名国际学生。',
  'Students in Canada have a number of options when it comes to accommodation. Whether you’re staying on campus or living in a private residence, you will be able to find the right housing for you.' => '加拿大的学生在住宿方面有很多选择。无论你是住在校园里还是住在私人住宅里，你都能找到适合你的住房。',
  'Get Financial Aid' => '获得经济援助',
  'As a Canadian citizen or permanent resident of Canada pursuing further studies in Canada, you may qualify for various forms of financial assistance. These are provided by organizations within or outside Canada and may include.' => '作为加拿大公民或加拿大永久居民在加拿大继续深造，您可能有资格获得各种形式的经济援助。这些由加拿大境内或境外的组织提供，可能包括。',
  'Canadian citizens and permanent residents of Canada do not require a study permit or visitor visa to study in Canada, regardless of their country of residence.' => '加拿大公民和加拿大永久居民在加拿大学习不需要学习许可证或访问签证，无论其居住国是什么。',
  'Some institutions have an international office to help international students prepare for life in Canada. These services will support your efforts prior to and following your arrival in Canada.' => '一些机构设有国际办事处，帮助国际学生为在加拿大的生活做好准备。这些服务将支持您在抵达加拿大之前和之后的努力。',
  'While studying at a postsecondary institution in Canada, you may have the option of working. This enables you to obtain Canadian work experience and generate income while you are studying.' => '在加拿大的高等教育机构学习期间，你可以选择工作。这使您能够在学习期间获得加拿大工作经验并创造收入。',
  'Because Canada is such an immense country, it is extremely varied in its people, landscape, climate, and way of life. However, Canadians do share important values such as pride, a belief in equality.' => '因为加拿大是一个幅员辽阔的国家，它的人口、地貌、气候和生活方式都千差万别。然而，加拿大人确实有共同的重要价值观，比如骄傲、平等的信念。',
  'Use the Directory of Occupational Profiles to learn about your intended occupation in Canada.' => '了解加拿大职业档案的使用。',
