  'Chinese students could send electronic verification reports (China Higher Education Student Record, China Higher Education Qualification Certificate, China Higher Education Student’s Academic Transcript, China National College Entrance Examination Results, China Secondary Education Qualification Certificate, China Secondary Education Student’s Academic Transcript and China High School Academic Proficiency Test Results) to the foreign universities via the WSE-foreign transmission service. Click “How to apply” link on the corresponding WSE-foreign portal page to view the details.' => '中国学生可以发送电子认证报告（中国高等教育学籍、中国高等教育学历证书、中国高等教育学生成绩单、中国高考成绩表、中国中等教育学历证书、中国中等教育学生的成绩单和中国高中学业水平测试结果）通过WSE对外传输服务发送到国外大学。单击相应的WSE foreign portal页面上的“How to apply”链接以查看详细信息。',
  'Includes the graduate, undergraduate and junior college levels' => '包括研究生、本科和大专',
  'Chinese students' => '中国学生',
  'Use “Name” and “ID Number” to register your WSE Archive, then check your student record (for those who have not completed their studies) or higher education qualification certificate (for those who have already graduated) information. If your student record or qualification certificate information cannot be found in your “WSE Archive”, please contact the related management department in your school to check your name and personal identification number. Then use “Name” + “Identification Number” to conduct a re-registration to check the existence of your educational information.' => '使用“姓名”和“身份证号”注册您的WSE档案，然后检查您的学生记录（未完成学业的学生）或高等教育资格证书（已毕业的）信息。如果您的学生档案或资格证书信息在您的“WSE档案”中找不到，请联系您所在学校的相关管理部门查询您的姓名和身份证号码。然后用“姓名”+“身份证号”进行重新注册，以检查您的教育信息是否存在。',
  'The personal information filled on the foreign school’s application websites should be consistent with that in your “WSE Archive”.' => '外国学校申请网站上填写的个人信息应与您的“WSE档案”中的信息一致。',
  'Please use the same personal identification number as filled in your WSE Archive when applying for “Verification Report of China Higher Education Qualification Certificate”, “Verification Report of China Higher Education Student’s Academic Transcript” and other verification reports.' => '申请《中国高等教育学历资格证书验证报告》、《中国高等教育学生学业成绩证明报告》等验证报告时，请使用与您的WSE档案中填写的相同的个人身份证号码。',
  'Students from other countries' => '其他国家的学生',
  'Please contact the related management department in your school to confirm the personal identification number used to register your student record and higher education qualification. Then use the same identification number to apply for the “Verification Report of China Higher Education Qualification Certificate”, “Verification Report of China Higher Education Student’s Academic Transcript” and other verification reports as filled on the foreign school’s application websites.' => '请与学校相关管理部门联系，确认用于登记学籍和高等教育资格的个人身份证号码。然后使用同一身份证号码在国外学校申请网站上填写《中国高等教育学历证书验证报告》、《中国高等教育学生学业成绩证明报告》等验证报告。',
  'Secondary' => '次要',
  'Includes the high-school and secondary vocational education levels' => '包括高中和中等职业教育水平',
  'The personal identification number used on the foreign school’s application websites, the WSE Archive registration, the application for “Verification Report of China National College Entrance Examination (Gaokao) Scores”, “Verification Report of China Secondary Education Qualification Certificate”, “Verification Report of China Secondary Education Student’s Academic Transcript”, “Verification Report of China High School Academic Proficiency Test (Huikao) Results” should be the same.' => '外国学校申请网站上使用的个人身份证号码，WSE档案注册，申请“中国高考分数线审核报告”，“中国中等教育学历证书审核报告”，“中国中等教育学生学业成绩验证报告”、“中国高中学业水平测试成绩验证报告”应相同。',
