  'Your official academic record (transcript) must also be sent directly to our office. Official academic record (transcript) must be signed, stamped, and dated by the officials (i.e. Registrar, Controller of Examination) of the awarding institution. Official academic record (transcript) must be in a sealed institution envelope with an institution stamp, a seal, or a signature over the back flap.' => '你的正式学习成绩（成绩单）也必须直接寄到我们办公室。正式成绩单（成绩单）必须由授予机构的官员（即注册主任、考试主管）签字、盖章并注明日期。正式学业成绩（成绩单）必须装在密封的学院信封内，信封背面盖有学校印章、印章或签名。',
