  'Agreement' => '协议',
  'I will arrange to have official academic record (transcripts) sent directly to WSE address given below, in an institution sealed envelope, unless otherwise specified under the Required Documents by Country of Education. This is a mandatory requirement for each credential you wish to have assessed. It is the applicant\'s responsibility to make this arrangement. WSE cannot order these documents for applicants.' => '我将安排将正式学业成绩（成绩单）直接寄至以下地址，装在学校密封的信封中，除非教育所在国要求的文件另有规定。这是您希望评估的每个凭证的强制要求。申请人有责任作出此安排。WSE不能为申请人订购这些文件。',
  'Student No' => '学生编号',
  'I have confirmed that the above shipping address information is accurate and authorize WSE to mail the assessment documents to the above address.' => '本人确认上述装运地址信息准确，并授权WSE将评估文件邮寄至上述地址。',
  'Need to agree terms' => '需要约定条款',
  'Applicant Agreement and Consent - Data Update' => '申请人协议和同意书-数据更新',
  'Applicant Agreement and Consent - General Application' => '申请人协议和同意书-一般申请',
  'I hereby request an assessment of the enclosed credentials. I certify that all statements and materials filed in support are true and genuine. I understand that in some cases, the Degree Assessment Education (DAE) of the WSE of Continuing Studies may ask to review my original documents and ask for additional documents and/or information. In addition, I acknowledge that documents submitted will not be returned to me and that all fees are final and non-refundable. I will notify WSE in writing of any change to my personal information or to my decision to designate a third party to represent me during the WSE application process.' => '兹请求对所附全权证书进行评估。我保证所有的声明和材料都是真实的。我知道在某些情况下，继续学习WSE的学位评估教育（DAE）可能会要求审阅我的原始文件，并要求提供更多的文件和/或信息。此外，我承认所提交的文件不会退还给我，所有费用都是最终的，不可退还。我将以书面形式通知WSE我的个人信息或我决定指定第三方在WSE申请过程中代表我。',
  'I hereby authorize WSE to contact the institution(s) that issued my academic documents for the purposes of' => '本人特此授权WSE联系签发我学术文件的机构，以便',
  'Verifying document authenticity' => '验证文档真实性',
  'Requesting information to assist in the assessment' => '请求信息以协助评估',
  'I furthermore authorize and direct the said institution(s) to release to WSE any information contained in their respective files concerning my educational records and any other information that may be relevant to my application for an Degree Assessment Education. I agree that I will be responsible for any applicable fees or verification costs required by my former institution(s).' => '此外，本人授权并指示上述机构向WSE公布其各自档案中有关我的教育记录的任何信息以及可能与我申请学位评估教育相关的任何其他信息。我同意，我将负责我以前所在机构要求的任何适用费用或验证费用。',
  'I authorize that my date of birth (DOB) be used for identification purposes on my Degree Assessment Education (DAE) Report. I understand that my personal information is being collected for the purpose of obtaining an DAE Report. I agree that WSE may retain my personal non-financial information for ten years from the date of my application, and that it may retain this information indefinitely if WSE determines that my documents are not authentic. I understand that measures will be taken in the event that my documents are determined to be false, including the nullification of any assessment reports already issued and notification to other credential assessment agencies and related government officials.' => '我授权在我的学位评估教育（DAE）报告中使用我的出生日期（DOB）作为身份证明。我知道我的个人信息是为获取DAE报告而收集的。本人同意自本人申请之日起十年内保留本人之个人非财务资料，如本公司认定本人之文件不具真实性，可无限期保留。我明白，一旦我的文件被确定为虚假，将采取措施，包括取消已发出的任何评估报告，并通知其他证书评估机构和相关政府官员。',
  'I hereby release the WSE, its agents, and any person or entity that provides information in accordance with this consent, from any and all actions, claims and demands for damages, loss, expense or injury, howsoever arising, which may hereafter be sustained by me as a result of the provision, collection, use or disclosure of information as set out above.' => '本人特此免除WSE、其代理人以及根据本同意书提供信息的任何个人或实体，免于因提供、收集、使用或披露所述信息而遭受的任何及所有损害、损失、费用或伤害的诉讼、索赔和要求以上。',
  'The WSE respects your privacy. Personal information you provide to the University is collected pursuant to section 2(14) of the WSE Act, 1971. The information you provide on this form will be used in assessing your request. At all times it will be protected in accordance with the Freedom of Information and Protection of Privacy Act. If you have any questions about WSE privacy measures, please contact WSE' => 'WSE尊重你的隐私。你向大学提供的个人信息是根据1971年《社会福利法案》第2（14）条收集的。你在这张表格上所提供的资料将用于评估你的申请。在任何时候，它都会受到信息自由和隐私保护法的保护。如果您对WSE隐私措施有任何疑问，请联系WSE',
  'I have read and agree to the WSE conditions' => '我同意阅读这些条件',
