  'Please only use this form if you have already submitted an application and you have received a notification from WSE regarding missing documents. This form may also be used if you wish to update any documents you have already uploaded, provide any missing documents to complete your application, or replace any submitted documents that are cut off, illegible, in black-and-white, or otherwise invalid.' => '如果您已经提交了申请，并且收到了WSE关于遗失文件的通知，请仅使用此表格。如果您希望更新已上传的任何文件，提供任何缺失的文件以完成您的申请，或替换任何被切断、难以辨认、黑白或其他无效的提交文件，也可以使用本表格。',
  'All documents uploaded MUST be clear and legible coloured photocopies.' => '所有上传的文件必须是清晰易读的彩色影印件。',
