  'Prepare and upload all required documents to the online IPG Application' => '准备并上传所有需要的文件到在线IPG应用程序',
  'Pay the full tuition through the online IPG Application. Payment is accepted by Visa, Mastercard, and AMEX only. We do not accept cash, debit, or personal cheques. If you need to pay by Canadian Bank Draft/money order (payable to the WSE) please complete and save your online application and then bring or mail the Canadian Bank Draft/money order to the following address:' => '通过在线IPG申请支付全额学费。仅Visa、Mastercard和美国运通接受付款。我们不接受现金、借记或个人支票。如果您需要通过加拿大银行汇票/汇票（支付给WSE）支付，请填写并保存您的在线申请，然后将加拿大银行汇票/汇票带到或邮寄至以下地址：',
  'IPG Program' => 'IPG计划',
  'Toronto, Ontario' => '安大略省多伦多市',
  'Application Approval Process' => '申请审批流程',
  'A receipt and Confirmation of Registration and Acceptance letter will be emailed once the online IPG Application is complete and the tuition is paid in full.' => '在线IPG申请完成并全额支付学费后，将通过电子邮件发送一份收据和注册和录取确认函。',
  'The fees associated with the application are as follows, and will be charged following completion of this application:' => '与申请相关的费用如下，并将在完成本申请后收取：',
  'Learners who require a letter to apply for a student visa can use the emailed Confirmation of Registration and Acceptance.' => '需要信函申请学生签证的学员可以使用电子邮件确认注册和录取。',
  'Application fee, non-refundable' => '申请费，不可退还',
  'CPS1 Semester 1 tuition fee' => 'CPS1第一学期学费',
  'Your application will be reviewed to ensure that the minimum requirements have been met. If they have not been met, a team member will reach out to you.' => '你的申请将被审核，以确保符合最低要求。如果他们没有见面，团队成员会联系你。',
  'Once your application has been approved or denied you will be contacted by email.' => '一旦您的申请被批准或拒绝，我们将通过电子邮件与您联系。',
  'IPG Program Document Requirements' => 'IPG项目文件要求',
  'Requirements:' => '要求：',
  'A copy of the letter stating that you have successfully completed the Pharmacy Examining Board of Canada (PEBC) Evaluating Examination.' => '证明您已顺利完成加拿大药剂学考试委员会（PEBC）评估考试的信函副本。',
  'Scan and save file as firstname_lastname-PEBC results' => '扫描文件并另存为firstname_lastname-PEBC结果',
  'A copy of your valid Objective English Language Proficiency test score that meets the minimum requirement. You can find a summary of minimum requirements on the' => '符合最低要求的有效客观英语水平测试成绩副本。您可以在上找到最低要求的摘要',
  'OCP website' => 'OCP网站',
  'If you are a native English speaker you may request a Non-Objective Evidence of Language Proficiency from the Ontario College of Pharmacists (OCP). In order to do so, you must have a file open with OCP in order for them to review your documents. You can find additional information on their website,' => '如果你是以英语为母语的人，你可以向安大略省药剂师学院（OCP）索取一份非客观的语言能力证明。为此，您必须在OCP中打开一个文件，以便OCP审阅您的文档。你可以在他们的网站上找到更多信息，',
  'here' => '在这里',
  'Scan and save file as firstname_lastname-Language Proficiency' => '扫描文件并将其另存为firstname_lastname-Language profectability',
  'A recent résumé with your current contact information; including address, email, phone number, and a summary of your education and career history in PDF format.' => '一份包含你当前联系信息的近期简历；包括地址、电子邮件、电话号码，以及PDF格式的教育和职业经历摘要。',
  'Scan and save resume file as firstname_lastname-Resume' => '扫描简历文件并将其另存为firstname_lastname-resume',
  'Visas and Study Permits' => '签证和学习许可',
  'Visa Requirements:' => '签证要求：',
  'Most foreign nationals require a Study Permit for the duration of the IPG Program. For more information on a Study Permit application, please visit' => '大多数外国人在IPG项目期间都需要学习许可证。有关学习许可申请的更多信息，请访问',
  'Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC)' => '加拿大移民、难民和公民身份部（IRCC）',
  'Please note:' => '请注意：',
  'It is your responsibility to arrange the correct visas and permits in order to study in Canada by following the application procedures set by' => '您有责任按照以下规定的申请程序安排正确的签证和许可证，以便在加拿大学习',
  'IRCC' => 'IRCC公司',
  'in your country.' => '在你们国家。',
  'In order to acquire a Study Permit you will need to submit your Confirmation of Registration and Acceptance letter. This will automatically be emailed to you once you complete the online IPG Application and the tuition is paid in full.' => '为了获得学习许可，您需要提交您的注册确认书和录取通知书。一旦您完成在线IPG申请并全额支付学费，该申请将自动通过电子邮件发送给您。',
  'We advise you apply well in advance of the admission deadline date to allow for sufficient processing time. Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) provides information about' => '我们建议您在入学截止日期前尽早申请，以便有足够的处理时间。加拿大移民、难民和公民身份部（IRCC）提供有关',
  'estimated processing times' => '估计处理时间',
  'The visa must be valid for the entire length of the IPG program.' => '签证必须在整个IPG项目期间有效。',
  'To view our most frequently asked questions, please visit our Help Centre.' => '要查看我们最常见的问题，请访问我们的帮助中心。',
