  'Note:' => '注：',
  'Please scan and upload a copy of your English Fluency exam or an OCP exemption letter. You can find a summary of minimum requirements on the' => '请扫描并上传你的英语流利性考试或OCP豁免信的副本。您可以在上找到最低要求的摘要',
  'Save file as' => '文件另存为',
  'firstname_lastname-LanguageProficiency' => '名字？姓氏-语言熟练程度',
