  'PROVIDE CONSENT' => '提供同意',
  'Agreement Part' => '协议部分',
  'I hereby certify that ALL information contained in this application is correct and complete.' => '兹证明本申请表所载资料均属正确及完整。',
  'I understand that by submitting this application and paying the fees I am confirming I meet all minimum admission requirements for the International Pharmacy Graduate (IPG) Program.' => '我明白，通过提交此申请并支付费用，我确认我符合国际药学研究生（IPG）课程的所有最低入学要求。',
  'The name shown on the application is the complete name by which I am legally and correctly known.' => '申请表上显示的姓名是合法和正确地认识我的全名。',
  'Any misrepresentation of this data may result in cancellation of my application, admission or registration to the International Pharmacy Graduate Program.' => '我的国际药剂学研究生入学申请或任何数据的错误陈述都可能导致我的国际药剂学研究生入学申请的取消。',
  'I understand that it my responsibility to submit all admission required documents by their required date, failure to do so may result in my admission offer being revoked.' => '本人明白，本人有责任在规定日期前提交所有入学所需的文件，否则可能导致本人的录取通知书被撤销。',
  'I understand that the IPG Program will provide my name and verify the admission requirements of identity, status, Fluency and PEBC Evaluating Examination results with, as well as provide course results to, the Ontario College of Pharmacists, or other relevant provincial regulatory College.' => '我了解IPG计划将提供我的姓名，并与安大略省药剂师学院或其他相关省级监管学院一起验证身份、状态、流利程度和PEBC评估考试结果的入学要求，并向其提供课程成绩。',
  'I understand that the information provided on this form, and throughout the application process, is necessary for WSE and Leslie Dan Faculty of Pharmacy for processing application, compiling general statistical information, and administering any and all programs and processes under the auspices of WSE and Leslie Dan Faculty of Pharmacy.' => '本人明白，本表格及整个申请过程中所提供的资料，对于WSE及Leslie Dan药剂学学院处理申请、编制一般统计资料、管理任何及所有由WSE及Leslie Dan药剂学学院主持的计划和流程是必需的。',
  'Do you consent to all of the items listed above?' => '你同意上面列出的所有项目吗？',
  'Explanation of Confirmation of Registration and Acceptance' => '登记受理确认书说明',
  'The Confirmation of Registration and Acceptance document is issued for the purposes of obtaining a visa to study in Canada. It is not confirmation that you have been admitted into the IPG program. To be admitted into the program you must meet the minimum requirements.' => '签发注册和录取确认文件的目的是获得加拿大留学签证。这并不是确认你已被录取进入IPG计划。你必须达到最低要求才能被录取。',
  'Upon submission of this online application, your application will be reviewed to confirm that you meet minimum requirements. You will be contacted once your application is approved or denied. If you do not meet minimum requirements, your tuition fee will be refunded to you.' => '提交此在线申请后，您的申请将被审核，以确认您符合最低要求。一旦您的申请被批准或拒绝，我们将与您联系。如果你不符合最低要求，你的学费将退还给你。',
  'Please confirm that you understand the purpose of the Confirmation of Registration and Acceptance letter and that admission into the IPG Program is only confirmed once your application has been approved.' => '请确认您理解注册确认书和录取通知书的目的，并且只有在您的申请获得批准后，才能确认您是否进入IPG计划。',
  'Do you confirm you understand the purpose of the Confirmation of Registration and Acceptance letter.' => '你确认你明白注册确认书和录取通知书的目的吗。',
  'I Confirm' => '我确认',
  'Application to Renew your WSE Degree Assessment Education for Canadian Immigration Programs' => '申请续签加拿大移民计划的WSE学位评估教育',
  'The Degree Assessment Education (DAE) has been designated by the Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada as of April 17th, 2013 to provide Degree Assessment Educations (DAE) for Canadian immigration programs.If you have obtained an DAE assessment report for immigration purposes from WSE that has since expired or about to expire,' => '自2013年4月17日起，加拿大移民、难民和公民身份部已指定学位评估教育（DAE），为加拿大移民提供学位评估教育（DAE）程序。如果您已经从WSE获得了一份移民DAE评估报告，该报告已过期或即将过期，',
  'For information about immigration programs visit' => '有关移民计划的信息，请访问',
  'Your application to renew your original WSE-DAE Report will require' => '您的申请更新您的原始WSE-DAE报告将需要',
  'A completed online application' => '已完成的在线申请',
  'A colour copy of both sides of your government-issued photo identification showing your date of birth' => '你的政府签发的显示你出生日期的照片证明的彩色复印件',
  'If your name has changed since the issuance of your report, please provide a copy of your marriage certificate or a proof of name change document showing both your former name and current name.' => '如果您的姓名在您的报告出具后发生了变化，请提供您的结婚证复印件或姓名变更证明文件，同时显示您的原名和当前姓名。',
  'A colour copy of your expired or about to expire WSE-DAE Report' => '已过期或即将过期的WSE-DAE报告的彩色副本',
  'Full payment of applicable WSE service fees' => '全额支付适用的WSE服务费',
  'Your assessment outcome may change to reflect current WSE policy. If it does, the new (renewed) report will supersede the previous report.' => '您的评估结果可能会改变，以反映当前的WSE政策。如果是这样，新的（更新的）报告将取代以前的报告。',
  'ENTER YOUR INFORMATION' => '输入您的信息',
  'Original Assessment Report Date' => '原评估报告日期',
  'Upload your expired or about to expire WSE-DAE Report' => '上载已过期或即将过期的WSE-DAE报告',
