  'Use this form if you would like to' => '如果你想用这个表格的话',
  'Authorize the release of information regarding your WSE Degree Assessment Education to a third party' => '授权向第三方发布有关您的WSE学位评估教育的信息',
  'Designate an individual or organization as your representative to WSE' => '指定个人或组织作为您在WSE的代表',
  'AUTHORIZATION TO RELEASE INFORMATION ABOUT MY Degree Assessment Education' => '授权发布我的学位评估教育信息',
  'Complete this section if you would like to authorize WSE to release information regarding your Degree Assessment Education to a third party. The individual or organization you authorize will be able to obtain information about the status of your application and the outcome of your assessment.' => '如果您想授权WSE将您的学位评估教育信息发布给第三方，请填写此部分。您授权的个人或组织将能够获得有关您的申请状态和评估结果的信息。',
  'I authorize WSE to release information to the following' => '我授权WSE向以下人员发布信息',
  'Request Duplicate Copies of WSE-DAE Report or Official Transcript V2' => '申请WSE-DAE报告或官方成绩单V2的副本',
  'Application to Request Duplicate Copies' => '申请复印件',
  'Complete this online application to have duplicate copies of your Degree Assessment Education (DAE) report or your Degree Assessment Education (DAE) assessment letter sent either to yourself or directly to a third party. CES assessment reports/letters issued after 1997 are available in most cases. Those issued prior to 1997 are no longer available.' => '完成此在线申请，以便将学位评估教育（DAE）报告或学位评估教育（DAE）评估信的副本发送给您自己或直接发送给第三方。在大多数情况下，可以获得1997年之后发布的CES评估报告/信函。1997年以前发行的已不再提供。',
  'You may also request for duplicate copies of your Official Transcript sent to an institutional third party along with WSE-DAE Report. This service is <b>conditional</b> upon WSE having received the Official Transcript directly from the issuing institution within 10 years prior to the submission of this application form, and only after your WSE-DAEReport has been issued. This service is available only if the issuing institution has not expressly forbidden WSE from forwarding the documents to a third party. Please note that it is your responsibility to ensure that duplicate copies of your Official Transcripts comply with the document requirements of the receiving organization / institution.' => '您也可以要求将您的官方成绩单副本与WSE-DAE报告一起发送给第三方机构。此项服务是有条件的</b>，前提是WSE在提交本申请表前10年内直接从签发机构收到正式成绩单，并且只有在您的WSE DAE报告已经签发之后。此项服务仅在签发机构未明确禁止WSE将文件转发给第三方的情况下提供。请注意，您有责任确保您的正式成绩单副本符合接收组织/机构的文件要求。',
  'The processing time is approximately five (5) business days upon receipt of your request and payment. Please note that processing times <b>do not </b>include delivery.' => '在收到您的请求和付款后，处理时间大约为五（5）个工作日。请注意，处理时间<b>不包括交付。',
  'Required Documents' => '所需文件',
  'DUPLICATE COPIES OF OFFICIAL TRANSCRIPT AND ADDITIONAL SERVICES' => '正式成绩单副本及额外服务',
  'Duplicate Copy of Official Transcript Service Fees' => '正式成绩单服务费副本',
  'Service' => '服务',
  'Fee Per Third Party' => '每第三方费用',
  'Duplicate Copy of Official Transcript' => '成绩单副本',
  'Request Duplicate Copy of WSE-DAE Report and Copy of Official Transcript' => '索取WSE-DAE报告副本和官方成绩单副本',
  'Send to Institutional Third Party' => '第三方机构',
  'I hereby request that WSE issue duplicate copies of my Degree Assessment Education report or my Degree Assessment Education (DAE) assessment letter as specified to be sent to me' => '我在此请求WSE出具我的学位评估教育报告或我的学位评估教育（DAE）评估信的副本，并按规定发送给我',
  'or sent to a third party, as per the instructions on this application.' => '或根据本申请书上的说明发送给第三方。',
  'I hereby request that WSE issues duplicate copies of my Official Transcript to an institutional third party, as per the instructions on this application.' => '我谨此请求WSE按照本申请书上的指示，向第三方机构出具我的正式成绩单副本。',
  'I will notify WSE in writing of any change to my personal information. I acknowledge that my date of birth (DOB) might appear for identification purposes on my Degree Assessment Education Report.' => '我将以书面形式通知WSE我的个人信息的任何变化。我承认我的出生日期（DOB）可能会出现在我的学位评估教育报告中以供识别。',
  'All fees are in Canadian dollars. We do not accept other currencies. Fees are subject to change without notice. All fees are final and non-refundable. If WSE is not able to fulfil the service, we reserve the right to cancel your application and refund you the full service fees.' => '所有费用均以加元计。我们不接受其他货币。费用如有变动，恕不另行通知。所有费用为最终费用，不可退还。如果WSE不能履行服务，我们保留取消您的申请并退还您全部服务费的权利。',
  'We are reviewing the information you submitted.' => '我们正在审查你提交的资料。',
  'We have received your application, we will process the information you submitted within 5 working days, please be patient.' => '我们已经收到您的申请，我们将在5个工作日内处理您提交的信息，请耐心等待。',
  'Not Started' => '未启动',
  'already submitted' => '已提交',
  'View Order' => '查看顺序',
  'Your copy request has been successfully passed.' => '您的复制请求已成功通过。',
  'Your application has been passed, we will send a copy to you by designated courier within 7 working days.' => '您的申请已经通过，我们将在7个工作日内通过指定的快递将副本发送给您。',
  'Your application has been saved as a draft.' => '您的申请已保存为草稿。',
  'You can click the steps on the right to continue or click the "Change Information" at the bottom to start from scratch.' => '您可以单击右侧的步骤继续，也可以单击底部的“更改信息”从头开始。',
  'Your data update request has been approved' => '您的数据更新请求已被批准',
  'We will revise the information you submit within 3 jobs.' => '我们将在3个作业中修改您提交的信息。',
  'You have successfully applied.' => '您已成功申请。',
  'We are evaluating the information you submitted, please be patient.' => '我们正在评估您提交的信息，请耐心等待。',
  'Under evaluation' => '评估中',
  'You have successfully assessed.' => '您已成功评估。',
  'We have successfully evaluated your information, please go to my storage to view the evaluation results.' => '我们已成功评估您的信息，请转到我的存储区查看评估结果。',
  'Application Fee' => '申请费',
  'CES DAE Report Renewal' => 'CES DAE报告更新',
  'expired IRCC report' => '过期的IRCC报告',
  'unpaid' => '未付',
  'Back To My Applications' => '回到我的应用程序',
  'Select "More Information" to see more details about a program and to start an application. If there is an application fee, you will not be required to pay it until you have completed and submitted the application.' => '选择“More Information”（更多信息）可查看有关程序的更多详细信息并启动应用程序。如果有申请费，在您完成并提交申请之前，您将不会被要求支付。',
  'Please <b>only use this form if you have already submitted an application</b> and you have received a notification from WSE regarding missing documents. This form may also be used if you wish to update any documents you have already uploaded, provide any missing documents to complete your application, or replace any submitted documents that are cut off, illegible, in black-and-white, or otherwise invalid.' => '请<b>仅当您已提交申请且收到WSE关于丢失文件的通知时使用此表格。如果您希望更新已上传的任何文件，提供任何缺失的文件以完成您的申请，或替换任何被切断、难以辨认、黑白或其他无效的提交文件，也可以使用本表格。',
  'All documents uploaded MUST be clear and legible coloured photocopies. Please scan all sides of each document, including blank sides.' => '所有上传的文件必须是清晰易读的彩色影印件。请扫描每份文件的所有面，包括空白面。',
  'Apply Now' => '立即申请',
  'Conditional fees may apply' => '可能会收取有条件的费用',
  'Duplicate WSE-DAE Report' => 'WSE-DAE报告重复',
  '(plus 13% HST) per set' => '（加13%HST）每套',
  'You can use this application to' => '您可以使用此应用程序',
  'Request Duplicate Copies of WSE-DAE Report/Send to A Third Party' => '向第三方发送重复的DAE/A报告副本',
  'Or' => '或者',
  'Request Duplicate Copies of Official Transcript Sent Directly to Institutional Third-Party' => '要求将正式成绩单副本直接发送给机构第三方',
  'OAA Course Enrollment Application for Intern' => 'OAA实习生课程报名申请表',
  'Choose the type of data to update' => '选择要更新的数据类型',
  'Education Promotion' => '教育促进',
  'Modify Storage Information' => '修改存储信息',
  'Data update service description' => '数据更新服务说明',
  'Data update should select different update types according to your current actual situation. Currently WSE only provides the above two data update methods. For specific data update instructions, please see the following:' => '数据更新应根据您当前的实际情况选择不同的更新类型。目前WSE只提供上述两种数据更新方法。有关具体的数据更新说明，请参阅以下内容：',
  '1. Education promotion: When you have already submitted an application in WSE, and the application education you submitted does not match your current education, you want to update the latest education information, then you can choose the data update method of "education improvement"' => '1教育促进：当您已经在WSE中提交了申请，并且您提交的申请教育程度与您当前的教育程度不匹配时，您需要更新最新的教育信息，然后可以选择“教育改善”的数据更新方式',
  '2. Modification of current academic information: If you have just applied for WSE recently, but your information is submitted incorrectly due to negligence, and the information on your assessment report is also wrong, you can submit relevant information to update your data' => '2修改当前学术信息：如果您最近刚刚申请了WSE，但由于疏忽导致您的信息提交错误，并且您的评估报告中的信息也有错误，您可以提交相关信息以更新您的数据',
  'Both are suitable for different application requirements, please determine your data update requirements before choosing. You can decide which data update method to use according to your different needs' => '两者都适合不同的应用需求，请在选择之前确定您的数据更新要求。您可以根据不同的需要决定使用哪种数据更新方法',
  'UPGRADE TO FULL ACCOUNT!' => '升级到完整帐户！',
  'Apply for Degree Assessed Storage' => '申请学位评定库',
  'Update description' => '更新说明',
  'In order to ensure that we can clearly understand what you want to change, please describe the information you want to change in detail below, if you want to change multiple pieces of information, please use the serial number to distinguish' => '为了确保我们能清楚地了解您要更改的内容，请在下面详细描述您要更改的信息，如果您要更改多条信息，请使用序列号进行区分',
  '1, E.g. My name is incorrect, I need to change my name to Paul George 2, The school name is wrong. I want to change the school name' => '1，例如我的名字不正确，我需要把我的名字改成保罗乔治2，学校的名字是错误的。我想改名',
  'Submit data replacement certificate' => '提交数据替换证书',
  'In order to ensure that the modification information you describe is correct, you need to submit proof of the information you want to modify to us to prove that the information you want to modify is currently wrong. If you have more information to modify, please add it below' => '为了确保您所描述的修改信息是正确的，您需要向我们提交您要修改的信息的证明，以证明您要修改的信息目前是错误的。如果您有更多信息需要修改，请在下面添加',
  'Please upload supporting documents' => '请上传证明文件',
  'Send certification/verification reports to international institution through WSE' => '通过WSE向国际机构发送认证/验证报告',
  'How to apply for data transfer?' => '如何申请数据传输？',
  'Log in to WSE' => '登录WSE',
  'If you cannot get an online certification report here' => '如果你不能在这里得到在线认证报告',
  'Please go to apply for a full account' => '请去申请全额帐户',
  'Go to "Data Transfer"' => '转到“数据传输”',
  'Choose the transmission method of "Institution-University Data Transmission" or "Mailbox Data Transmission"' => '选择“院校数据传输”或“邮箱数据传输”的传输方式',
  'Institution/University Data Transmission' => '院校数据传输',
  'Sample' => '样品',
  'Select transmission agency' => '选择传输机构',
  'The data will be transferred to the organization you choose, please choose carefully.' => '数据将传送到您选择的机构，请慎重选择。',
  'Verify the accuracy of transmitted data' => '验证传输数据的准确性',
  'Preview and transfer data and target organization.' => '预览和传输数据和目标组织。',
  'Transfer application completed' => '转账申请已完成',
  'Wait for the transmission result (about 5-7 working days to complete the entire institution/university transmission).' => '等待传输结果（大约5-7个工作日完成整个机构/大学传输）。',
  'Email Data Transmission' => '电子邮件数据传输',
  'Fill in the data transmission acceptance mailbox' => '填写数据传输接收邮箱',
  'The data will be sent to this mailbox, please fill in carefully.' => '数据将发送到此邮箱，请认真填写。',
  'Preview and confirm the transmission data and fill in the mailbox.' => '预览并确认传输数据并填写邮箱。',
  'Waiting for the transmission result (about 24h working days to complete the entire mailbox transmission).' => '等待传输结果（约24小时工作日完成整个邮箱传输）。',
  'Go to “International Cooperative Application” under “WSE” to send reports to your applied institution.' => '前往“WSE”下的“国际合作申请”向申请机构发送报告。',
  '（Flowchart of Cooperative Application）' => '（合作申请流程图）',
  'Firstly complete the online application according to WSE’s requirement. Then follow the instructions below to apply for verification report(s) and submit to international institution through the WSE Portal Service.' => '首先根据WSE的要求完成在线申请。然后按照以下说明申请验证报告，并通过WSE门户服务提交给国际机构。',
  'STEP 1:' => '第一步：',
  'a WSE ACCOUNT' => 'WSE帐户',
  'If you do not have a WSE account yet, you need to go to the registration page to apply for an account. If you already have a WSE account, you can ignore this step.' => '如果您还没有WSE帐户，则需要转到注册页来申请帐户。如果您已经拥有WSE帐户，则可以忽略此步骤。',
  'Go to registers' => '转到寄存器',
  'STEP 2:' => '第二步：',
  'Find the service application page to submit the information' => '找到服务应用程序页面以提交信息',
  'If you have already registered your WSE account and successfully logged in, you can go to the application page to fill in the information and submit the information as prompted.' => '如果您已经注册了您的WSE帐户并成功登录，则可以转到应用程序页面填写信息，并按提示提交信息。',
  'Go to register' => '前往登记处',
  'STEP 3:' => '第三步：',
  'After you fill in all the information and submit all the information, we will evaluate your information in about 5 working days. Of course, if the information you submit is not true, we will not evaluate your information.' => '在您填写所有信息并提交所有信息后，我们将在大约5个工作日内评估您的信息。当然，如果您提交的信息不真实，我们不会评估您的信息。',
  'STEP 4:' => '第四步：',
  'After we have verified your information without problems and successfully made an assessment, we will notify you by email and mail the documents to your home.' => '在我们确认您的信息无问题并成功进行评估后，我们将通过电子邮件通知您，并将文件邮寄到您的家中。',
  'STEP 5:' => '第五步：',
  'After you have successfully received the evaluation document and confirmed that it is correct, we will store your information and data in the blockchain. This process will take a while.' => '在您成功收到评估文件并确认其正确无误后，我们会将您的信息和数据存储在区块链中。这个过程需要一段时间。',
  'Note: Pricing of WSE\'s Verification Reports' => '注：WSE验证报告的定价',
  'Contact:' => '联系人：',
  'Countries students could send electronic verification reports (Higher Education Student Record, Higher Education Qualification Certificate, Higher Education Student’s Academic Transcript, National College Entrance Examination Results, Secondary Education Qualification Certificate, Secondary Education Student’s Academic Transcript and High School Academic Proficiency Test Results) to the foreign universities via the WSE-foreign transmission service. Click “How to apply” link on the corresponding WSE-foreign portal page to view the details.' => '各国学生可发送电子核查报告（高等教育学生档案、高等教育资格证书、高等教育学生成绩单、全国高考成绩、中等教育资格证书、，中等教育学生的成绩单和高中学业水平测试结果）通过WSE对外传输服务发送到国外大学。单击相应的WSE foreign portal页面上的“How to apply”链接以查看详细信息。',
  'Canada students' => '加拿大学生',
  'Please use the same personal identification number as filled in your WSE Archive when applying for “Verification Report of Canada Higher Education Qualification Certificate”, “Verification Report of Canada Higher Education Student’s Academic Transcript” and other verification reports.' => '申请“加拿大高等教育资格证书验证报告”、“加拿大高等教育学生成绩单验证报告”等验证报告时，请使用与您的WSE档案中填写的相同的个人识别号。',
  'Please contact the related management department in your school to confirm the personal identification number used to register your student record and higher education qualification. Then use the same identification number to apply for the “Verification Report of Higher Education Qualification Certificate”, “Verification Report of Higher Education Student’s Academic Transcript” and other verification reports as filled on the foreign school’s application websites.' => '请与学校相关管理部门联系，确认用于登记学籍和高等教育资格的个人身份证号码。然后使用同一身份证号码在国外学校申请网站上填写《高等教育学历证书验证报告》、《高等学校学生学业成绩证明报告》等验证报告。',
  'The personal identification number used on the foreign school’s application websites, the WSE Archive registration, the application for “Verification Report of Canada National College Entrance Examination (Gaokao) Scores”, “Verification Report of Canada Secondary Education Qualification Certificate”, “Verification Report of Canada Secondary Education Student’s Academic Transcript”, “Verification Report of Canada High School Academic Proficiency Test (Huikao) Results” should be the same.' => '外国学校申请网站上使用的个人身份证号码，WSE档案注册，申请“加拿大高考成绩验证报告”，“加拿大中等教育资格证书验证报告”，“加拿大中等教育学生成绩单验证报告”、“加拿大高中学业水平测试（会考）成绩验证报告”应相同。',
  'Reasons for failure of audit' => '审核失败原因',
  'Data description' => '数据描述',
  'transfer method' => '转移方法',
  'Mechanism transmission' => '机构传动',
  'You have successfully applied, please try again in 7 days' => '您已成功申请，请在7天后再试',
  'Please select the report to transfer' => '请选择报表',
  'Performance report' => '业绩报告',
  'third-party certification' => '第三方认证',
  'Send Certificate Report Template' => '发送证书报告模板',
  'You need to pay for the transmission fee!' => '你需要付传输费！',
  'Get file information' => '获取文件信息',
  'Checking uplink information' => '检查上行链路信息',
